      },
      "formations": "From age 11, armies hold formations: shield wall, flanking, reserves. Earlier fights are brawls.",
      "wounds": "Fighters are wounded before they die; healers (age 12+) and rest bring them back.",
      "aftermath": [
        "surrender and prisoners",
        "ransom or forced labour",
        "truce",
        "vassalage",
